<MainLayout title="Our mission" description="The proposed mission of Vijayman Unnatdhara Welfare Foundation." eyebrow="Our mission"><section class="section shell prose"><SectionHeading title="Service that begins with listening." text="This is proposed working language awaiting approval by the foundation." /><p class="lead">To support meaningful participation and inclusive development through responsible social welfare, community engagement and service-oriented action.</p><h2>What that means in practice</h2><p>We believe a responsible foundation starts by understanding people and context. It makes room for participation, documents what it does and stays honest about what is known, what is in progress and what still needs to be learned.</p><p>When the foundation’s authorized representatives approve a final mission statement, this page will be updated accordingly.</p></section></MainLayout>
